      "payload": {
        "reason": "done",
        "note": "(1) server.ts: every route now registers HEAD alongside GET via a readMethods() helper (Bun's routes table doesn't fall HEAD back onto GET automatically — verified live: HEAD /tickets 404'd before, 200s with correct Content-Length and empty body after). (2) stale.ts: review rows now sort/label by review.requested_at via overlays.ts's computeStaleReason (same anchor isTicketStale already uses), not last_activity_at, so an unrelated update --progress note can no longer make a rotting MR look fresher. New tests: D5.test.ts HEAD-requests block + web-stale-panel-review-anchor.test.ts (built a real repo where requested_at/last_activity_at diverge, confirmed the test fails against the old code). Full verification suite green.",
